Subject: [PATCH] perf(sync): skip proven-empty outbox observation opens
 [daveey]

WIP implementation checkpoint, not a live CPU acceptance claim. Retain fresh positive/deadline work and use existing data_version observation. Reopen BoardWatch on main-file mtime/size movement to reject equal-header restore reuse. Proof: empty reopen count RED (2 vs 0), GREEN; equal-header restore RED then expanded consumer GREEN. Remaining: attribution, comprehensive mutants, review, CI, collector and mature-idle gate.
---
 hermes_cli/kanban_sync_board_watch.py         |  10 +-
 hermes_cli/kanban_sync_outbox_age.py          |   7 ++
 .../test_kanban_sync_empty_outbox.py          | 110 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_sync_empty_outbox.py

diff --git a/hermes_cli/kanban_sync_board_watch.py b/hermes_cli/kanban_sync_board_watch.py
